#: title/pc5_ui.c:6741
msgid "Graphics memory"
msgstr "Mémoire graphique"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6743
msgid "All 8 GB: the game may take memory the rest of it needs"
msgstr "Les 8 Go : le jeu peut prendre la mémoire dont le reste a besoin"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6744
msgid ""
"More for the game's textures, less for the rest; Auto if it runs out of "
